window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Once you have a taste of fate, you’ll do anything to savour it again. Stepping out from behind bars, Luke Jones has to navigate a world that he doesn’t understand. Unsure where to turn, he manages to find unexpected work. But it’s not what he wants. All he cares about is delivering revenge on those who wronged him in his past and finding the woman he met three years ago. The one who gave him hope.</p> <p></p> <p>Eva.</p> <p></p> <p>Eva Robinson’s dreams to find the right care for her father and work her dream job, come to a grinding halt after one unexpected night. Despite everything, life for Eva changes in the most beautiful of ways, even if she knows she isn’t living it to the fullest.</p> <p></p> <p>That is until Luke Jones makes his way back into her life and shows her who she truly is again.</p> <p></p> <p>Fate may be destined, but for Luke and Eva, it unearths hidden truths that have the power to destroy everything they want.</p>"; 
